Description: A hierarchical spatiotemporal point-pattern framework for analyzing animal tracking data. Provides tools for movement-state segmentation (behaviorally-anchored Local Moran), temporary habitat delineation (DBSCAN at a behaviorally-derived spatial scale), migration phase identification (a data-driven Migration Phase Index with density-valley phase classification), nest detection (stratified spatiotemporal DBSCAN), site fidelity quantification, and circadian rhythm analysis.
